e noninstitutionalized U.S. adult population.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Survey weights were calibrated to state-level vaccine administration data reported to CDC as of June 15, 2021.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"T-tests and PRs were considered statistically significant if p-values were <0.05.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}